# Model card for vctk (medium)

* Language: en_GB (English, Great Britain)
* Speakers: 109
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://datashare.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/3443
* License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

## Training

Finetuned from the U.S. English hifi_tts_92 base model (medium quality; the voice of Cori Samuel, Hi-Fi TTS reader 92), with MRD and SDP.

Trained on the VCTK 0.92 `mic1` recordings (48 kHz), resampled to 22,050 Hz.

Default inference settings are noise_scale 0.333 and noise_w 0.5.

Requires Piper 1.5 or higher.
